{"article_id": "id_ighipx0ugivh", "title": "5.3、格式：没有按照目标投稿期刊的格式调整你自己论文的格式。", "speaker": "安迪（本地主题作者标签；不推断外链网页署名）", "reading_scope": "已完整逐行阅读当前本地主题嵌入版本的文字；图片/视频/外链未读；远端文章版本未核实", "quote": "比如下面每一个section之前都没有序号", "claim": "投稿前应按目标期刊调整稿件格式；作者以本稿section未编号作为未落实格式要求的具体例子。", "boundary": "本地只有这个单一例子及未读图片，没有期刊名或指南；不能推出所有期刊都要求章节编号，也不能凭已读文字认定格式已修好。", "actions": ["对照目标期刊当前作者指南确认章节编号规则。", "逐级核查标题与编号，记录所依据的指南条款和修改位置。"], "evidence_text_file": "texts/06ec37c7c96583c3c7a551d5c634263accdc626ecffef8f00244ed2680b971bd.md", "evidence_content_sha256": "06ec37c7c96583c3c7a551d5c634263accdc626ecffef8f00244ed2680b971bd", "local_body_topic_id": "588524115841544", "creation_method": "manual_after_full_text_read_not_automatic_keyword_summary", "reading_round": "round2_full_text_tool_read", "clean_text_chars": 87, "han_chars": 55, "source_topic_ids": ["211254825414111"], "quote_span": {"start_char_zero_based": 47, "end_char_exclusive": 68, "line_start_one_based": 3}, "remote_version_verified": false, "images_read": false, "full_text_line_count": 5, "card_id": "ARTICLE-id_ighipx0ugivh", "topic_id": "588524115841544", "source_path": "source-workspace-not-bundled/article-text/texts/06ec37c7c96583c3c7a551d5c634263accdc626ecffef8f00244ed2680b971bd.md", "source_url": "https://articles.zsxq.com/id_ighipx0ugivh", "origin_card_file": "source-workspace-not-bundled/article-text/cards/id_ighipx0ugivh.json", "review_status": "local_embedded_version_read_remote_version_not_verified"}
{"article_id": "id_jbmqu9nwf3n8", "title": "2.1、结果与讨论-文字：上下文出现自我攻击和矛盾的情况。这种矛盾有时候是非常直接和明显的，有时是通过间接推测/推理的。", "speaker": "安迪（本地主题作者标签；不推断外链网页署名）", "reading_scope": "已完整逐行阅读当前本地主题嵌入版本的文字；图片/视频/外链未读；远端文章版本未核实", "quote": "全文都是不可以前后矛盾的", "claim": "综述跨段拼接不同文献时，容易把同一体系先写成低导电、低氧化电位，后又称快离子传输和宽窗口，而不解释对象、年代或条件；反复夸1D、2D、3D也不能形成可用比较。实验部分的pure ZnO与混合电极、短反应时间不能均匀却又称均匀，同样需要消解。", "boundary": "不同年代、成分和测试条件下的结果可以共存，明确这些条件可能消除表面矛盾；这是阅读者补充，不把引文差异自动判定为事实错误。较小颗粒与均匀分布是不同指标。图片及原引用未独立核实。", "actions": ["建立对象—条件—指标—结论表，跨段扫描同一对象的相反描述。", "综述比较写出适用范围与取舍，不只轮流给每种结构最高评价。", "把电极组成、图注和结果句互核，删除没有依据的pure、uniform等修饰。"], "evidence_text_file": "texts/f117f9697bcdb3ac2072649cbf53b7e61ffc82875799c6f18ccdfeb8b3167e52.md", "evidence_content_sha256": "f117f9697bcdb3ac2072649cbf53b7e61ffc82875799c6f18ccdfeb8b3167e52", "local_body_topic_id": "411542885821858", "creation_method": "manual_after_full_text_read_not_automatic_keyword_summary", "reading_round": "round2_full_text_tool_read", "clean_text_chars": 4214, "han_chars": 1075, "source_topic_ids": ["211254825414111"], "quote_span": {"start_char_zero_based": 3583, "end_char_exclusive": 3595, "line_start_one_based": 51}, "remote_version_verified": false, "images_read": false, "full_text_line_count": 65, "card_id": "ARTICLE-id_jbmqu9nwf3n8", "topic_id": "411542885821858", "source_path": "source-workspace-not-bundled/article-text/texts/f117f9697bcdb3ac2072649cbf53b7e61ffc82875799c6f18ccdfeb8b3167e52.md", "source_url": "https://articles.zsxq.com/id_jbmqu9nwf3n8", "origin_card_file": "source-workspace-not-bundled/article-text/cards/id_jbmqu9nwf3n8.json", "review_status": "local_embedded_version_read_remote_version_not_verified"}
